{
  "name": "the-page-must-have-the-last-word",
  "rule": "`answered` means the Page spoke LAST, not that the Page appears somewhere in the thread.",
  "why": "T-11. The triage read `.some(isPage)`, so visitor -> Page -> visitor came back `answered` while the customer was still waiting. activity.ts states the invariant in its own source \u2014 over-surface rather than hide a waiting customer \u2014 so this was a bug against the repository's written design, not a change of policy.",
